{"apparatus":"Two complete real Bell sources and Bell analyzer on the data coordinates. Endpoint plane density (I+nu Q)/4, Q=-J_A J_C. Alice uses signed Z, X, or J_data J_plane between Ramsey Hadamards. Charlie measures a synchronized controlled V=(3A +/- 4B)/5 between Ramsey Hadamards. A three-bit Walsh, conditional signed permutation and inverse Walsh implement one oracle call. Coarse clean-port read, then alternating adjoint/forward recovery. Timeouts emit a fresh fair local bit. No settings or Bob outcomes are dropped.","table_order":"Each bin_indices array contains 288 entries. Outer to inner: Alice Z,X,Y; ordered Charlie pair ZX,ZY,XY and plus,minus within pair; Bob (00,10,01,11) parity then phase; outcomes (a,c)=(++,+-,-+,--). Look up the index in completed_bin_dictionary or the desired unconditional_bin_dictionary. Both give joint p(a,b,c|x,z), including Bob. Timeout_joint_per_abc is the raw contribution of timeout in any bin; divide each timeout word mass by 16 for its individual joint contribution. Each success word contributes its mass times the completed bin.","selector":"All six nominal signed selectors were propagated from every one of the eight input basis columns. For every success history the selected operator is one common scalar times 5I on idle and 3A +/- 4B on acted. Every terminal failure-word Gram matrix is scalar identity. The coarse pointer is essential. Reverse-weight control permutes coefficient roles, giving 4A +/- 3B, with the same local success Gram factors by exchange of the signed involutions. Reversing the tilt swaps the two Charlie settings under held scoring labels.","columns_tested":8,"selector_settings_tested":6,"shared_record_weights":[{"retry_pairs":0,"timeout_words":{"0":"39/64"},"success_words_at_or_before_deadline":{"1":"25/64"},"timeout":"39/64"},{"retry_pairs":1,"timeout_words":{"000":"24375/262144","010":"59319/262144"},"success_words_at_or_before_deadline":{"1":"25/64","001":"38025/262144","011":"38025/262144"},"timeout"